{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","max_tokens":768,"stream":true,"system":"Keep the answer short.","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Find the unique integer selector from 1 through 99 that has remainder 2 when divided by 5, remainder 0 when divided by 7, and remainder 7 when divided by 11. Work out the constraints before answering. Use get_value with the derived selector to obtain the stored value. Do not guess the stored value."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking multiples of 7 against the conditions: I need one that's 2 mod 5 and 7 mod 11. Testing 7 itself: 7 mod 5 = 2, and 7 mod 11 = 7 — it satisfies everything, so x=7 works.\n\n"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V74E9Co8rRqmjFfDjBEJ28","name":"get_value","input":{"selector":7},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01V74E9Co8rRqmjFfDjBEJ28","content":"7"}]}],"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"tools":[{"name":"get_value","description":"Return the stored integer for the selector.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"selector":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["selector"],"additionalProperties":false}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"auto"},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}}